inburgh</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="b28"><label>28</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Irwin</surname><given-names>WG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A new academic career structure in General Practice in Northern Ireland</article-title><source>J Roy Coll Gen Pract</source><year>1980</year><volume>30</volume><issue>221</issue><fpage>740</fpage><lpage>2</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7230110</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b29"><label>29</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hadden</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The editors of the Ulster Medical Journal</article-title><source>Ulster Med J</source><year>2006</year><volume>75</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>5</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16457399</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b30"><label>30</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Logan</surname><given-names>JI</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Transactions of the Belfast Medical Society, Belfast Clinical and Pathological Society and the Ulster Medical Society, with background notes</article-title><source>Ulster Med J</source><year>2006</year><volume>75</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>72</fpage><lpage>79</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16457408</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b31"><label>31</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morrison</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Colour vision</article-title><source>Ulster Med J</source><year>2006</year><volume>75</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>2</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b32"><label>32</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Knox</surname><given-names>JD<